{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"eve-sdl-install-precommit","description":"Legacy (pre-1.0 IDE) twin of eve-sdl-install-precommit.json. Auto-installs the AI-DLC SDL git pre-commit hook into this project so the user never has to copy it. Fires on promptSubmit (pre-1.0 has no SessionStart trigger, same as eve-sdl-preflight.kiro.hook) and delegates to eve-sdl-install-precommit.sh (plain sh, no bun): wires a thin pre-commit wrapper into the repo's git hooks dir that execs .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-precommit.sh. Idempotent, non-destructive, makes no git config changes. Set AIDLC_SDL_NO_PRECOMMIT_INSTALL=1 to opt out.","when":{"type":"promptSubmit"},"then":{"type":"runCommand","command":"sh .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-install-precommit.sh"}}
